      "path": "main.cpp",
      "text": "struct Clock {\n    virtual long now() const = 0;\n};\n\nstruct Timer : Clock {\n    Timer(int ticks);\n    [[nodiscard]] long elapsed(int scale) const noexcept;\n    const char* label() const;\n    long now() const override { return 0; }\n};\n\nTimer::Timer(int ticks) {}\n\nauto tick(int step) -> long {\n    return step;\n}\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nT twice(T value) requires (sizeof(T) > 1) {\n    return value + value;\n}\n",
